# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): abox-different-clash's control. Only a sameAs b; p, q and w stay all
# different and fold into one representative, as different individuals in a disjoint union.
# Expect: consistent.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:X a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual .
:a owl:sameAs :b .
:p a owl:NamedIndividual , :X . :q a owl:NamedIndividual , :X . :w a owl:NamedIndividual , :X .
[ a owl:AllDifferent ; owl:distinctMembers ( :p :q :w ) ] .
